  "description": "AG-UI endpoint for Tracon. Connects a front end that speaks the AG-UI protocol (CopilotKit and others) to a Tracon agent: text streams as AG-UI events, front-end tools run on the front end, tool approvals and requests for input are AG-UI interrupts. The run, the tenant, the roles, the session owner, the approval trail and the cost stay Tracon's.",
